  "written_names": [
    "cache Map: session shape and get set has iteration delete clear inspection stay compatible",
    "cache cardinality: thirty-third distinct native response evicts the oldest of thirty-two",
    "cache byte pressure: three native three-MiB papers evict before cardinality pressure",
    "cache exact bytes: two four-MiB native bodies fill the cap and one extra byte evicts",
    "cache exact admission: a single eight-MiB retained text is accepted",
    "cache over admission: eight-MiB plus one byte is refused without replacing a healthy identity",
    "cache UTF-8: three two-MiB ASCII texts retain six MiB",
    "cache UTF-8: three two-MiB code-unit accented texts retain only two four-MiB entries",
    "cache UTF-8: supplementary code points use four bytes and admit no ninth-MiB hit",
    "cache LRU: a valid tool hit promotes its path before cardinality eviction",
    "cache LRU: ordinary Map inspection does not promote a path",
    "cache LRU: valid promotion selects deterministic eviction under byte pressure",
    "cache expiry: a fresh hit removes an unrelated entry at the TTL boundary",
    "cache expiry: a miss removes all unrelated stale entries before admission",
    "cache TTL: the preceding millisecond hits and equality requires a new response",
    "cache admission expiry: an unrelated entry expires before a new timestamp is admitted",
    "cache age overflow: individually finite clock and timestamp cannot produce an infinite-age hit",
    "cache rollback: future timestamps at unrelated paths are removed before a fresh return",
    "cache clocks: NaN and both infinities return validated successes without retention or hits",
    "cache clocks: strings null and undefined are not silently coerced into evidence",
    "cache admission metadata: unusable timestamps cannot replace a healthy Map entry",
    "cache mutated text: an oversized inspected entry cannot become a hit",
    "cache mutated weights: aggregate byte pressure is remeasured before a requested hit",
    "cache mutated timestamps: nonnumeric metadata cannot yield a coerced fresh hit",
    "cache isolation: independent sessions retain their own values and clearing one preserves the other",
    "cache replacement: shrinking a value releases its old weight without evicting other values",
    "cache replacement: growing a value counts its replacement once and evicts the oldest other value",
    "cache deletion: deleting and clearing full entries leave no phantom byte pressure",
    "cache uncached success: nonfinite admission time still returns the complete validated result",
    "cache concurrency: a late malformed native JSON response retains a newer healthy identity",
    "cache concurrency: late native HTTP 404 and 500 failures retain a newer healthy identity",
    "cache concurrency: an injected native abort and late response retain a newer healthy identity",
    "cache concurrency: malformed-hit invalidation cannot delete a replacement admitted during validation",
    "cache concurrency: late native body failure preserves a newer healthy result and sanitizes errors",
    "cache compatibility: all six tool schemas and exact results survive eviction and refetch"
  ],
